WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Don't be shameless

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,310
You know how you got this job and you don't have to pay for it.

3
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:07,510
I'm going to report you for having sex with men and women.

4
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:09,230
You won’t be able to keep your job by then

5
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:10,870
Shen Xi's reputation was also ruined

6
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:12,350
Let’s see how she gets married in the future

7
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:28,220
From the moment you humiliated Xiao Xi

8
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,860
I just want to beat you up

9
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:35,430
A bunch of things that don’t know whether to live or die

10
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,740
How dare you come to borrow food from me?

11
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:44,100
Who else wants to borrow it now?

12
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,760
Get out of here

13
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:56,220
I'm here

14
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:59,510
No one can bully you, Brother Qin
